# ==== Keil MDK-ARM (uVision / ARMCC / ARMCLANG) build intermediates ====
# Objects, dependency files, cross-reference files, listings, link maps,
# final images and reports produced by compiling in Keil. None of these
# are needed to open/build the project in Keil on another machine.
*.o
*.d
*.crf
*.lst
*.axf
*.hex
*.bin
*.lnp
*.map
*.dep
*.htm
*.iex
JLinkLog.txt
JLinkSettings.ini
EWARM.log

# Default Keil output folder names (kept in case the project is
# reconfigured to use them instead of a folder named after the project).
Objects/
Listings/

# uVision per-user / per-machine GUI & workspace state (window layout,
# open files, breakpoints view, last debug session) — not needed to build.
*.uvguix.*

# Backup files uVision sometimes leaves behind.
*.bak
*.~*

# STM32CubeMX backup
*.ioc.bak

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
